{"id": "t087-060", "text": "krisztina hurt her calf at parkrun sat so she's out of the half. gutted after all that training. aurelio still running it. remind me to ask him how it went the monday after", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "krisztina", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "hurt her calf", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "sat", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "half", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "gutted", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "aurelio", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask him how it went", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the monday after", "anchor": "a1"}]}
